WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.747 --> 00:00:07.129
(upbeat electric guitar music)

00:00:07.129 --> 00:00:08.711
- [Announcer] Who's the
fairest of them all?

00:00:08.711 --> 00:00:10.268
We're going to find out by pitching

00:00:10.268 --> 00:00:12.976
two of the world's most bad-ass
women against each other

00:00:12.976 --> 00:00:15.069
in a head-to-head battle.

00:00:15.069 --> 00:00:16.646
First up, Snow White.

00:00:16.646 --> 00:00:18.250
Don't let the name fool you,

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:20.443
or the fact she's been
asleep for a long time.

00:00:20.443 --> 00:00:22.376
She has a solid command of martial arts,

00:00:22.376 --> 00:00:24.821
including German jiu-jitsu and fencing,

00:00:24.821 --> 00:00:27.358
as well as the ability to
bend the will of nature

00:00:27.358 --> 00:00:28.490
to her command.

00:00:28.490 --> 00:00:31.294
She has at her faculty, a
number of special attacks,

00:00:31.294 --> 00:00:34.062
including a leaping nature fist and rage,

00:00:34.062 --> 00:00:35.628
which increases her overall power

00:00:35.628 --> 00:00:37.158
the more she gets attacked.

00:00:37.158 --> 00:00:39.191
She is also rumored to be nearly immortal

00:00:39.191 --> 00:00:42.941
and will tend to sleep
off any mortal wounds.

00:00:44.308 --> 00:00:45.827
On the other side of the field we have

00:00:45.827 --> 00:00:49.600
the spirit of the north, Elsa,
who simply cannot let it go.

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:51.037
A grudge, that is.

00:00:51.037 --> 00:00:53.507
Her ability to magically
control ice is only bested

00:00:53.507 --> 00:00:56.909
by her temper and her strong
command of muay Thai boxing.

00:00:56.909 --> 00:00:58.561
Her fighting regime is bolstered by

00:00:58.561 --> 00:01:02.089
two blistering special
attacks, freeze touch and

00:01:02.089 --> 00:01:04.055
avalanche, a vice grip-like attack

00:01:04.055 --> 00:01:06.271
which is rumored to be inescapable.

00:01:06.271 --> 00:01:07.854
Elsa is widely considered one of the

00:01:07.854 --> 00:01:10.021
most powerful women alive.

00:01:11.377 --> 00:01:13.443
- I'm going to go with
Snow White, cuz she's O.G.

00:01:13.443 --> 00:01:14.371
- Elsa has the advantage.

00:01:14.371 --> 00:01:16.289
Although, Snow White's pretty scrappy,

00:01:16.289 --> 00:01:17.824
cuz she grew up in the woods.

00:01:17.824 --> 00:01:21.473
- Snow White has nothing
on Elsa, except for all

00:01:21.473 --> 00:01:25.357
of her woodland creatures
would like ban to her side.

00:01:25.357 --> 00:01:29.389
And so I think that would
give her a fighting chance.

00:01:29.389 --> 00:01:32.128
But I legit think Elsa
would kick Snow White's ass.

00:01:32.128 --> 00:01:33.438
Like pretty intensely.

00:01:33.438 --> 00:01:35.709
- Snow White has to be
rescued by a prince,

00:01:35.709 --> 00:01:37.502
she doesn't wield any sort of weaponry.

00:01:37.502 --> 00:01:39.768
Sounds like Elsa at least has powers.

00:01:39.768 --> 00:01:41.458
- Snow White always kinda
felt like she had her

00:01:41.458 --> 00:01:43.754
head in the clouds, you know what I mean?

00:01:43.754 --> 00:01:47.533
Whereas Elsa straight-up
almost killed her sister.

00:01:47.533 --> 00:01:49.116
- [Announcer] Well, there you have it.

00:01:49.116 --> 00:01:51.708
Our fighters are geared
up and ready to go.

00:01:51.708 --> 00:01:54.002
Let's see who'll win this royal battle.

00:01:54.002 --> 00:01:56.585
(upbeat music)

00:02:28.305 --> 00:02:30.223
Elsa starts out with flurry of attacks,

00:02:30.223 --> 00:02:32.170
easily blocked by Snow White, who parries,

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:34.337
as if floating on a cloud.

00:02:35.995 --> 00:02:36.828
Clinch.

00:02:36.828 --> 00:02:39.014
Elsa has the advantage here, if she can.

00:02:39.014 --> 00:02:41.593
There we go, it's the freeze touch.

00:02:41.593 --> 00:02:43.549
She's very shaken up by that left hook,

00:02:43.549 --> 00:02:44.677
but as the fight progresses,

00:02:44.677 --> 00:02:47.050
Snow White becomes
enraged and more powerful.

00:02:47.050 --> 00:02:49.561
She's back at it, going for the take down.

00:02:49.561 --> 00:02:51.525
Eats a couple of ice-hot
elbows to the back.

00:02:51.525 --> 00:02:54.192
Snow White now with a nice shoulder throw.

00:02:54.192 --> 00:02:56.859
(blows landing)

00:02:59.748 --> 00:03:02.161
Elsa is down and Snow
White is on the offensive.

00:03:02.161 --> 00:03:04.411
(grunting)

00:03:08.743 --> 00:03:10.576
Elsa is fighting back.

00:03:13.484 --> 00:03:15.481
She's raging hard.

00:03:15.481 --> 00:03:18.310
Now Snow White has launched
into her leaping nature fist.

00:03:18.310 --> 00:03:20.893
Can Elsa get out the way?

00:03:20.893 --> 00:03:21.976
(blow landing)

00:03:21.976 --> 00:03:23.143
Oh, big blow.

00:03:28.613 --> 00:03:30.842
Snow White has the advantage
here, now on the ground,

00:03:30.842 --> 00:03:32.836
going for the rear naked choke.

00:03:32.836 --> 00:03:35.086
(grunting)

00:03:37.038 --> 00:03:38.848
Oh, but she can't sink it.

00:03:38.848 --> 00:03:39.858
She better watch out.

00:03:39.858 --> 00:03:42.525
Elsa is dangerous on the ground.

00:03:46.531 --> 00:03:48.047
Oh, no, she's got her.

00:03:48.047 --> 00:03:48.880
Avalanche.

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:49.713
This doesn't look good.

00:03:49.713 --> 00:03:52.130
This could be the end, folks.

00:03:53.711 --> 00:03:55.044
- Go. Let it go.

00:03:59.790 --> 00:04:03.040
- [Announcer] And Snow White is asleep.

00:04:39.134 --> 00:04:43.051
(upbeat electric guitar music)

